OL,3,GNEWSATerror-accused denies wanting to
OL,4,Amake bomb vest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of terrorism offences has
OL,7,Fdenied he wanted to make an explosive
OL,8,Fvest, a trial has heard.
OL,10,FAbdullah Yousef, 24, told a jury at
OL,11,FBirmingham Crown Court he had no
OL,12,Fexplanation for a message he is alleged
OL,13,Fto have sent on social media saying: "I
OL,14,Fam a terrorist."
OL,16,FProsecutors allege he had been a member
OL,17,Fof the so-called Islamic State (IS) and
OL,18,Fwanted to join the terror group in
OL,19,FAfrica.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
