OL,3,GNEWSATerror-accused denies wanting to
OL,4,Amake bomb vest
OL,5,
OL,6,FYousef, of Galapagos Grove, in
OL,7,FBletchley, Milton Keynes, has denied
OL,8,Fhaving membership of a proscribed
OL,9,Forganisation (IS), collecting
OL,10,Finformation of a kind likely to be
OL,11,Fuseful to a terrorist and six counts of
OL,12,Fdissemination of terrorist
OL,13,Fpublications.
